{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19141","headline":"白舍人见酬拙诗因以寄谢 · 刘禹锡","name":"白舍人见酬拙诗因以寄谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽陪三品散班中，资历从来事不同。\n名姓也曾镌石柱，诗篇未得上屏风。\n甘陵旧党凋零尽，魏阙新知礼数崇。\n烟水五湖如有伴，犹应堪作钓鱼翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}